[{"title":"送素庵刘总管归","author":"黄清老","text":"当年绣斧出九天，倏如白云下长川。\n千峰收雨作秋色，至今梧竹吟寒泉。\n熙台重来又三载，干将出匣光不改。\n冰浆尽贮明月秋，风露冥冥接沧海。\n海空迢迢行玉麟，霜影荡漾龙蛇惊。\n石田归来紫芝好，策马更入南山青。\n渔阳歌两岐，何如阳春生物物不知。\n鲁人颂泮水，何如弦歌一千里。\n昆也虎渡河，宽也蒲作鞭。\n何如樵溪九曲落叶静，平铺绿水栽红莲。\n紫微殿前列藩辅，华盖苍苍五星聚。\n夔龙䠥?天一方，蟋蟀吟秋桂枝暮。\n蓬莱枫叶昨夜秋，璚楼梦觉题金瓯。\n银河横空白鸾去，安得追逐钧天游。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":28201,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"行路难","author":"黄清老","text":"奉君七宝凤凰之绣柱，五色麒麟之锦囊。\n王母九霞觞中之酒，秦女万缕炉中之香。\n去年红花今日开，昨日红颜今日老。\n一生三万六千日，欢日颇多愁日少。\n对吴歌，看楚舞，歌舞匆匆变今古。\n归去来，莫行路。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":28202,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"送三山张国宝府掾美归","author":"黄清老","text":"三山星斗高贴天，三山潮汐走百川。\n张公平生饮中仙，襟度脱落神飘然。\n三山神人不敢友，天风吹度金鳌颠。\n扫清案牍待明月，平铺绿水栽红莲。\n公庭无人山色落，时有双燕归帘前。\n樵溪夜雨深一尺，城外明朝翠如织。\n春归草木不可遮，黯澹已作离别色。\n离别兮奈何，若有人兮佩女萝。\n公不顾兮山之阿，山之阿，沧海渺渺浮云多。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":28203,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"县令行","author":"黄清老","text":"石田海上秋不热，抱琴入山翠如簇。\n白云一榻流水深，独对青松结茅屋。\n西风唤起泥涂身，野冠未见天上人。\n灵丹一粒肯分与，便当负水耕炊薪。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":28204,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题高都事戴崧二牛图","author":"黄清老","text":"东风吹浪翻平林，吴江咫尺移春阴。\n牧童晓出不知雨，日暮归去清溪深。\n一童驱牛涉古岸，草烟惨澹迷目观。\n双蹄涌出层水间，苍峡蹴翻石云断。\n一童踞策溪中流，溪风不动波悠悠。\n恍然顾影惊自失，尚疑身跨苍龙游。\n平澜远峰结寒色，至今宇宙留墨迹。\n可怜三子人不识，我欲问之汉津客。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":28205,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"送海东之","author":"黄清老","text":"海东之，玉关之人奈子何！\n一朝趋试当大廷，搜奇抉秘如悬河。\n胸中二三策，发愤精研磨。\n中山兔毫渴濡染，绿文臣研出大沱。\n御卷足挥霍，如见山人泰华江之番。\n紫髯长戟冻不折，浊流鼓枻冰峨峨。\n得官固好好，东之情最真，遂使吾侬日相亲。\n不誇文字雄，退与寒士相推尊。\n淫哇郑卫非所云，阖闾城边种杨柳，柳江柳子子亦闻。\n我有刻玉书，愿与穷朝昏。\n子若修之可凌云，不废世间功与名。\n况闻子弟功策勋，一门科第凡五人。\n琼林之中翱且翔，如此文文而章章。\n所以青城樵者有歌曰：海东之，兄弟三人如凤凰。\n我歌曰：二雏亦复鸣朝阳。\n再歌曰：二雏亦复鸣朝阳。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":28206,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"登平远台鳌顶峰","author":"黄清老","text":"六鳌簸荡玄圃碎，三岛崩腾失空翠。\n海风掣断南山云，分我沧江半江水。\n台南岩谷青岌岌，奇松怪石作人立。\n山巅恐有风雨来，林径空濛落花湿。\n水东屴崱结平绿，积雾飞岚坐堪掬。\n蓬莱迢迢几万里，一碧天光浸寒玉。\n吟翁回首看不足，缓步策驴度空谷。\n谁知咫尺山中幽，望断残晖立修竹。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":28207,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"天马山","author":"黄清老","text":"溪随天马西北行，半空忽见莲花生。\n双鸾欲下却飞去，旌旗引入丹霞城。\n攀萝上到猿啼处，恍然旷坐消百虑。\n千山无人云气深，终日徘徊不能去。\n虚空楼阁时自开，异香忽起三清台。\n风吹笑语落天半，疑是神仙跨鹤来。\n百花潭上春自照，白鹿呼人猿亦啸。\n路迷不敢轻问津，恐有贤人隐耕钓。\n苍厓九折樵径通，绝顶可见西崆峒。\n尘心豁然臂欲羽，竦身直上凌天风。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":28208,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"与索编修士岩访马学士伯庸于蓬莱馆因观藤花","author":"黄清老","text":"昔访蓬莱馆，春烹芍药牙。\n重来寻竹径，久坐落藤花。\n君欲鸣瑶瑟，予将拾紫霞。\n鹤吟知雨近，留宿白云家。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":28209,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"送人之金陵答赠张质夫","author":"黄清老","text":"林塘残月晓，松露滴清声。\n此日佳人别，空山碧草生。\n江湖双白鸟，风雨一啼莺。\n解缆春花发，悠悠万里情。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":28210,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"送欧子归旴并寄江西诸友","author":"黄清老","text":"旴水曾游处，燕城独眺时。\n雁来惟我在，叶落祇秋知。\n风雨连今昔，江湖重别离。\n送君芳草色，千里见相思。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":28211,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"晚春过城西","author":"黄清老","text":"林塘密叶静，禽语绿波翻。\n坐想青云士，幽寻白石村。\n西山遥下榻，芳草欲移轩。\n时有渔樵侣，春风载笑言。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":28212,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"寻故人","author":"黄清老","text":"适兴一寻君，君家在白云。\n幽花秋后见，落叶夜深闻。\n随意坐苔石，呼童煮涧芹。\n不须谈世事，诗思正纷纷。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":28213,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"留别","author":"黄清老","text":"相寻复相别，把酒意如何？\n云石有时合，风湍无定波。\n此生无出处，一笑对嵯峨。\n长揖下山去，暮烟浮女萝。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":28214,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"哭朱教授竹所","author":"黄清老","text":"日问竹平安，凄然泣白鸾。\n讲堂春寂寂，归路夜漫漫。\n前度成虚设，斯文已不刊。\n些声云谷外，落月带微寒。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":28215,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"兴圣殿进史","author":"黄清老","text":"瑶编初进侍清光，日丽龙池昼刻长。\n堤柳染成春水色，宫花并入御炉香。\n金壶洒露层阶滑，玉椀分冰广殿凉。\n矇瞍似知天意喜，凤笙新奏五云章。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":28216,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"贡闱偶成呈同院诸公","author":"黄清老","text":"射宫围棘断经过，閒却秋声太液波。\n风定碧帘闻禁漏，夜残银烛见星河。\n仙人共对青藜杖，词客孤眠白玉坡。\n弱水蓬莱三万里，不知何处月明多？","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":28217,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"雪夜直宿玉堂","author":"黄清老","text":"琪树花生禁漏迟，金茎月色近书闱。\n白云入水春无迹，银汉横空夜有辉。\n竹静似闻苍玉佩，松寒欲傍绿荷衣。\n乾坤清气蓬莱表，独对天风拂素徽。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":28218,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"寄刘宰凤溪","author":"黄清老","text":"玉署芸香课石经，江湖无复旧诗名。\n日移宫树春怀友，花落天阶晓听莺。\n沧海料应流不尽，白云安得与同行。\n君行十八滩头路，为说相思万里情。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":28219,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"巧夕偶书","author":"黄清老","text":"几叶梧桐暮雨收，綵棚尊俎候牵牛。\n青鸾西去瑶池冷，乌鹊南飞碧水流。\n屋角月明三尺竹，河边云湿数星秋。\n天风扫退尘间梦，一曲金徽独倚楼。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":28220,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"夜宴友人席上有怀志能照磨暮春会同年所作因寄二首 其一","author":"黄清老","text":"碧池开冰朱夏凉，瑶席倚翠芙蕖香。\n清歌夜半起秋籁，妙舞风前摇露光。\n云行星月递隐见，雁度河汉相低昂。\n青山对面隔一水，渺渺长空愁欲霜。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":28221,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"夜宴友人席上有怀志能照磨暮春会同年所作因寄二首 其二","author":"黄清老","text":"青山林下啼斑鸠，绿杨门前嘶紫骝。\n落花成阵作春雨，东风淡淡云悠悠。\n美人卷帘日在手，胡蝶飞上珊瑚钩。\n南山不见笋成竹，拟约沧波同倚楼。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":28222,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"丁丑三月七日会同年于城南子期工部仲礼省郎世文编修文远照磨学升县尹子威主事克成秘书至能照磨子通编修凡十人二首 其一","author":"黄清老","text":"曾记城南尺五天，重来携手宴同年。\n春风远塞蒲萄酒，明月佳人玳瑁筵。\n苔上药阑红染露，莺啼柳径碧生烟。\n琼林十载多离别，欲拂金徽思渺然。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":28223,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"丁丑三月七日会同年于城南子期工部仲礼省郎世文编修文远照磨学升县尹子威主事克成秘书至能照磨子通编修凡十人二首 其二","author":"黄清老","text":"川凫浴日金粼粼，垂杨马嘶三月春。\n游蜂舞蝶总爱客，飞絮落花时近人。\n东风吹水入银瓮，芳草为我铺绿茵。\n更催朝露染魏紫，舞袖一拂南山尘。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":28224,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"张志道别都门","author":"黄清老","text":"竹寺西轩共听琴，杏花犹记紫囊吟。\n溪山老我扁舟兴，风雨知君万里心。\n沧海夜潮银汉湿，蓬莱春树碧云深。\n三年离别尊前话，倾倒何时更似今。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":28225,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"柳絮风","author":"黄清老","text":"三月韶光天气清，游丝舒卷太无情。\n微飘帘幕当春昼，乱扑亭台似雪晴。\n醉脸欲吹新燕弱，舞腰初软落花轻。\n江头点点行人泪，相逐离歌洒客程。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":28226,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"梧桐雨","author":"黄清老","text":"曾将秋信报人知，又与西风泣别离。\n病绿滴残犹有泪，题红流去更无诗。\n旧巢凤冷朝飞远，古井金寒晓汲迟。\n待得楚台云散后，却凭琴调寄相思。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":28227,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题平翠楼","author":"黄清老","text":"华楼突兀摩苍天，青吟飞上神飘然。\n虚阑六曲拂云起，莲峰千仞当尊前。\n晴岚带雾结秋色，修竹过雨鸣寒泉。\n东风一笑歌石鼓，心期试问金鳌仙。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":28228,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"友人拟古乐府因题十绝句 其一","author":"黄清老","text":"早晚临妆镜，秋容怯玉钿。\n君心如日月，照妾似初年。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":28229,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"友人拟古乐府因题十绝句 其二","author":"黄清老","text":"采荇归来午，花梢日转廊。\n绿阴凉似水，不用洗红妆。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":28230,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"友人拟古乐府因题十绝句 其三","author":"黄清老","text":"生爱东邻女，蛾眉画不如。\n近来机杼废，临得右军书。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":28231,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"友人拟古乐府因题十绝句 其四","author":"黄清老","text":"漫道从军乐，风霜只独居。\n三年辽水上，不得一行书。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":28232,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"友人拟古乐府因题十绝句 其五","author":"黄清老","text":"海上扶桑景，清光日见君。\n祇愁风雨夜，西北有浮云。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":28233,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"友人拟古乐府因题十绝句 其六","author":"黄清老","text":"今夜中秋月，含情独上楼。\n辰星三两点，偏照玉帘钩。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":28234,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"友人拟古乐府因题十绝句 其七","author":"黄清老","text":"自见南楼月，频频梦楚州。\n无端今夜雨，祇作小山秋。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":28235,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"友人拟古乐府因题十绝句 其八","author":"黄清老","text":"露井疏桐晚，风亭碧藕秋。\n卷帘山月上，水宿见双鸥。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":28236,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"友人拟古乐府因题十绝句 其九","author":"黄清老","text":"堂上春花老，流泉日绕山。\n愿为双白鹤，云路载君还。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":28237,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"友人拟古乐府因题十绝句 其十","author":"黄清老","text":"天子西巡狩，彤弓锡虎臣。\n楼兰何日斩，看汝画麒麟。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":28238,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"望云","author":"黄清老","text":"日出五丈高，白云浩如海。\n城郭在云中，山人在云外。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":28239,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"忆昔寄子静弟","author":"黄清老","text":"忆昔走马寻丹丘，醉卧白云溪上楼。\n黄石桥东两松树，一夜水长到梢头。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":28240,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"怀友时住夏玉泉山","author":"黄清老","text":"远水平林翠绕城，秋来风雨动离情。\n玉泉千尺梧桐树，月下时闻落叶声。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":28241,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"登岸书所见寄魏亨道","author":"黄清老","text":"紫霞摇日花满川，渔翁不归鸥在船。\n白云悠然渡水去，平野秋色青连天。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":28242,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"寄刘凤溪时有麻源之约不果往","author":"黄清老","text":"南国佳人鬓欲丝，仙坛孤负杏花期。\n多情惟有东桥水，流到瓜州月上时。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":28243,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题牧牛图","author":"黄清老","text":"平原雨多烟草浮，牧童驱牛如挽舟。\n柴门正在水深处，青山流过屋西头。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":28244,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"偶题二首 其一","author":"黄清老","text":"永夜观儿课旧编，小窗灯火忆当年。\n曲肱自笑不成寐，月上瑶琴第五弦。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":28245,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"偶题二首 其二","author":"黄清老","text":"雪夜题书玉署深，思山便欲寄瑶琴。\n征鸿若问平安信，河汉东流是此心。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":28246,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题鄱阳方氏心远亭二首 其一","author":"黄清老","text":"湖上千峰碧染衣，琴轩春雨白鸥归。\n无人共语乾坤外，燕子南来雁北飞。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":28247,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题鄱阳方氏心远亭二首 其二","author":"黄清老","text":"柴门垂柳晓啼鸦，露径苔封芍药芽。\n分得鄱阳云一半，自携春雨种黄花。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":28248,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"春晚","author":"黄清老","text":"春老他乡奈老何，可人红紫渐无多。\n閒来绿柳坡头路，记得流莺第一歌。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":28249,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"题春江小景图","author":"黄清老","text":"小艇无人载绿阴，白鸥门外笋成林。\n不知多少山中雨，染得一江春雨深。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":28250,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"钱塘怀友","author":"黄清老","text":"舟泊风林一雁声，白蘋红蓼共思君。\n月明江水多于海，雨后秋山碧似云。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":28251,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"登福山遇僧偶出二首 其一","author":"黄清老","text":"欲叩禅关未有诗，满山空翠湿人衣。\n竹间倚杖到西日，试问白云归未归。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":28252,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"登福山遇僧偶出二首 其二","author":"黄清老","text":"鹫岭云深杖屦幽，竹风松影共悠悠。\n何人分得僧家榻，坐看南山一片秋。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":28253,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"赠江玉成","author":"黄清老","text":"千里还家独抱琴，象山杳在白云林。\n晚寒莫厌江东路，人倚梅花雪意深。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":28254,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"友人见访不遇","author":"黄清老","text":"君乘白鹤下青云，我入春山听晓莺。\n可惜小楼风雨过，无人收拾万松声。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":28255,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"送马编修","author":"黄清老","text":"军山流水绕旴城，曾记维舟听晓莺。\n君过柳阴聊驻马，春风叶叶是离情。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":28256,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"感兴二首 其一","author":"刘诜","text":"秦人燔诗书，圣道散若烟。\n宫殿干斗极，东游问神仙。\n汉祖祠孔子，遂为百代先。\n大哉礼乐意，所见何卓然。\n因势道其趋，勇赴如决川。\n但恨群臣间，馀习犹櫜鞬。\n良平虽善虑，不在三代前。\n安得豁达□，一见贾少年。","collection":"元","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":28257,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"感兴二首 其二","author":"刘诜","text":"金张贵朝廷，卫霍列茅社。\n奴隶凌虹霓，亲戚折五霸。\n斗鸡驰鄠杜，射虎宿浐灞。\n意气骄盛时，咳唾有光价。\n相如涤器夫，万里驰驷马。\n买臣最微贱，怀绶出邸舍。\n贤愚何必齐，时至俱气化。\n岂无单綀士，叩角五陵夜。\n太史重成名，寂寞千秋下。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":28258,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"春寒閒居五首 其一","author":"刘诜","text":"贫居托幽巷，久雨客来绝。\n春寒霰时集，淅沥在高叶。\n鸟鸣日已宴，寂寂茶鼎歇。\n惭无晁氏智，懒事主父谒。\n闭门自读书，庶以励高节。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":28259,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"春寒閒居五首 其二","author":"刘诜","text":"潇潇山城雨，摵摵书馆风。\n喔喔邻屋鸡，迢迢远坊钟。\n遐思在古人，展转魂梦通。\n抱拙俗所弃，岁晚将谁同。\n赋成不轻卖，金尽当忍穷。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":28260,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"春寒閒居五首 其三","author":"刘诜","text":"久寒卉木寂，初旭阴翳谢。\n春浅有令姿，澹澹在平野。\n山明孤烟发，天迥一鸟下。\n积忧鲜旷怀，怡咏聊此暇。\n赋诗勿锼刻，养生师叔夜。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":28261,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"春寒閒居五首 其四","author":"刘诜","text":"昔时如花人，今年兀若株。\n华滋散安在，嗜好岂不殊。\n河水不灌翳，春风不归枯。\n闻道须少日，立功无暮涂。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":28262,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"春寒閒居五首 其五","author":"刘诜","text":"西里夜回烛，东邻朝玩山。\n相视无羡心，丰约自不关。\n芳草满幽庭，日宴人未还。\n久阴忽微暄，孤禽语花间。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":28263,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"吴宁极惠和閒居五诗复用韵为谢 其一","author":"刘诜","text":"嗜澹务坟素，端居世机绝。\n微风被崇梢，撩乱书几叶。\n山家晨烟薄，日晏远春歇。\n庭寒掩馀蕙，剥啄谢过谒。\n幽怀忽浩然，高咏脱音节。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":28264,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}},{"title":"吴宁极惠和閒居五诗复用韵为谢 其二","author":"刘诜","text":"衰发如素雪，一往随飘风。\n怅然平生怀，危坐闻远钟。\n守身易成隘，应俗或谓通。\n不惜举世稀，所慕知者同。\n傍偟岂有求，寂默非伤穷。","collection":"元","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"元.csv","pointer":28265,"sha256":"83a9b19069eb9d0a23ec0c2824878cf918a857896ec1ca33cebdf7438cc165a8","dynasty":"元"}}]